<title>USA: Dawson-Samberg holds 8.7 pct NUKO stake.</title>
<headline>Dawson-Samberg holds 8.7 pct NUKO stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by Dawson-Samberg Capital Management Inc said Thursday it holds an 8.7 percent stake or 905,600 common shares in NUKO Information Systems Inc.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said its stake includes 130,600 shares purchased between September 11 and 25 at prices ranging from $9.75 to $17.75 a share.</p>
<p>The group said it holds the stake for investment.</p>
</text>
